# Aviatrix SIEM Connector - Edge-case corpus
#
# Variants, malformed input and negative cases that the main corpus
# (test-samples.log) does not cover. Used by test-tools/golden/golden.py only.
# The E2E count check (validate-output.sh) does not read this file, so cases can
# be added here without touching its expected counts.
#
# Every line has a "# @case <id> [avx=<first release>] [until=<last release>]"
# annotation (see test-tools/golden/README.md). The expected files record what
# the current pipeline does. Where that is a known bug, the description says
# "KNOWN BUG" and what the correct result would be, so a fix shows up as an
# intended change to the expected files.
#
# Sources:
#   [copilot]  CoPilot repo: logstash avxlogs.conf comment samples, avx-log-gen
#              generators, UI fixtures (paths in the description)
#   [oteld]    oteld repo enums (proto/logs/v1/dcf_logs.proto, avx-oteld-gateway.yaml)
#   [synth]    built from a real sample by changing only the noted fields
# All public IPs are TEST-NET (192.0.2.0/24, 198.51.100.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24);
# domains are example.com.

